('115.12.b.2.C',2,'A shot from a doctor that helps protect you from certain sicknesses is called a...','["book", "toy", "snack", "vaccine"]'::jsonb,3,'Vaccines help prevent disease.','original'),
('115.12.b.2.D',2,'If you see tiny bugs in your hair that make your head itch, tell...','["a grown-up or the nurse", "your pet", "a stranger", "the wall"]'::jsonb,0,'Adults know how to treat lice.','original'),
